(7265676, 1130305, 163430, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10! My first vote in this challenge.<br/>I tried a similar concept, but the results were not as near as good as yours. I will post outtakes.</td>', 'Perfect 10! My first vote in this challenge.I tried a similar concept, but the results were not as near as good as yours. I will post outtakes.', '2014-09-24 06:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
