(7265974, 1130481, 86447, '<td valign="top">I just don''t see water.<br/> <br/>I don''t think if I had to give twenty words to describe this, that I''d come up with "water".<br/> <br/>Ok.  I''ve challenged myself.<br/> <br/>shoe<br/>shadows<br/>rough<br/>contrast<br/>texture<br/>brown<br/>art<br/>dark<br/>light<br/>shapes<br/> <br/>Arg.   I''m so uncreative!  I can only come up with ten.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>Trying some more:<br/> <br/>sepia<br/>abstractness<br/>can opener<br/> <br/>Arg.<br/> <br/>You try.  <br/>:D</td>', 'I just don''t see water. I don''t think if I had to give twenty words to describe this, that I''d come up with "water". Ok.  I''ve challenged myself. shoeshadowsroughcontrasttexturebrownartdarklightshapes Arg.   I''m so uncreative!  I can only come up with ten.   Trying some more: sepiaabstractnesscan opener Arg. You try.  :D', '2014-09-24 21:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
