(7266912, 1130488, 108891, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2014-09-27 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267190, 1130127, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely light.  Beautiful deep tones.  Makes me remember something but I don''t know what exactly.  Which is far better than knowing.  In my 7+ list.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely light.  Beautiful deep tones.  Makes me remember something but I don''t know what exactly.  Which is far better than knowing.  In my 7+ list.  Thank you.', '2014-09-29 08:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267192, 1130136, 30364, '<td valign="top">Has an alien quality. An outpost in another world.  A docking station for other-worldy travellers.  Certainly more than a boat launch ramp.  Into my 7+ selections.  Thank you.</td>', 'Has an alien quality. An outpost in another world.  A docking station for other-worldy travellers.  Certainly more than a boat launch ramp.  Into my 7+ selections.  Thank you.', '2014-09-29 08:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267193, 1130427, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully weird.  Really nice water tones too.  There''s a submerged ninja breathing through a reed between the walker''s stilts.  Bonus point for the ninja, and straight into my 7+ list.  Thank you.</td>', 'Wonderfully weird.  Really nice water tones too.  There''s a submerged ninja breathing through a reed between the walker''s stilts.  Bonus point for the ninja, and straight into my 7+ list.  Thank you.', '2014-09-29 09:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267196, 1130001, 30364, '<td valign="top">Fabulously unfinished.  We need (I mean the world, not just DPC) a lot more unfinished pictures.  And a lot less finished pictures.  Almost everything is happening outside your frame, and yet it''s undeniably happening.  It''s a wonderful artistic impulse about withholding meaning, reduced right to the very edge of absurdity, and then pulled just a little bit back into the viewer''s reach.  I feel like a dog whose chain just permits him to lick the edge of his bowl, but won''t quite allow him to reach the nourishing marrowbone jelly inside.  Into my 7+ picks you go, and thank you.</td>', 'Fabulously unfinished.  We need (I mean the world, not just DPC) a lot more unfinished pictures.  And a lot less finished pictures.  Almost everything is happening outside your frame, and yet it''s undeniably happening.  It''s a wonderful artistic impulse about withholding meaning, reduced right to the very edge of absurdity, and then pulled just a little bit back into the viewer''s reach.  I feel like a dog whose chain just permits him to lick the edge of his bowl, but won''t quite allow him to reach the nourishing marrowbone jelly inside.  Into my 7+ picks you go, and thank you.', '2014-09-29 09:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267198, 1130480, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a sort of Cirque du Soleil of water.  In my 7+ selections.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s a sort of Cirque du Soleil of water.  In my 7+ selections.  Thank you.', '2014-09-29 09:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267200, 1130419, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s more beautiful than it looks at first.  By which I mean that it <i>is</i> beautiful at first, but becomes even more beautiful with further contemplation.  The less obvious details  the teasing horizontals; the gradient in the water cascade  turn out to be the source of this second and deeper level of loveliness.  It''s in my 7+ selections.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s more beautiful than it looks at first.  By which I mean that it is beautiful at first, but becomes even more beautiful with further contemplation.  The less obvious details  the teasing horizontals; the gradient in the water cascade  turn out to be the source of this second and deeper level of loveliness.  It''s in my 7+ selections.  Thank you.', '2014-09-29 09:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267202, 1130479, 30364, '<td valign="top">Just the perfect amount of everything, including nothing.  Among my 7+ picks.  Thank you.</td>', 'Just the perfect amount of everything, including nothing.  Among my 7+ picks.  Thank you.', '2014-09-29 09:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267203, 1130397, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh it''s rubbish, but I''m a sucker for rubbish.  You find the most unexpected beauty there, just like this.  It''s in my 7+ picks.  Thank you.</td>', 'Oh it''s rubbish, but I''m a sucker for rubbish.  You find the most unexpected beauty there, just like this.  It''s in my 7+ picks.  Thank you.', '2014-09-29 09:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267204, 1130481, 30364, '<td valign="top">Why not?  Beauty, as in truly wondrous beauty, is in what''s possible rather than what''s certain.  What''s promised rather than what''s delivered.  I''m pleased that you left so much of the picture up to me.  Into my 7+ picks it goes, and thank you.</td>', 'Why not?  Beauty, as in truly wondrous beauty, is in what''s possible rather than what''s certain.  What''s promised rather than what''s delivered.  I''m pleased that you left so much of the picture up to me.  Into my 7+ picks it goes, and thank you.', '2014-09-29 09:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267208, 1130041, 24073, '<td valign="top">This shot could of challenged the best shots in the challenge with a few minor adjustments. The sky could of been more interesting, and the water up front could of used a higher aperture causing a crisp clean look.  All in all, you could probably still use some simple techniques in photoshop to enhance this a little.  That said, I still think you met the challenge head on, and got a great shot, so I ranked it pretty high.  It would just be really hard to stand this beside the best shots in the challenge.</td>', 'This shot could of challenged the best shots in the challenge with a few minor adjustments. The sky could of been more interesting, and the water up front could of used a higher aperture causing a crisp clean look.  All in all, you could probably still use some simple techniques in photoshop to enhance this a little.  That said, I still think you met the challenge head on, and got a great shot, so I ranked it pretty high.  It would just be really hard to stand this beside the best shots in the challenge.', '2014-09-29 09:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267211, 1130477, 24073, '<td valign="top">you hit my weak spot, great capture.  I thought originally that a landscape should win this challenge.  I doubt this one will win, just because of the underexposure and a few minor imperfections, but it got a very high vote from me.  thank you for sharing.</td>', 'you hit my weak spot, great capture.  I thought originally that a landscape should win this challenge.  I doubt this one will win, just because of the underexposure and a few minor imperfections, but it got a very high vote from me.  thank you for sharing.', '2014-09-29 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267212, 1130418, 149964, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and movement captured in this.  One of my favourites</td>', 'Love the colours and movement captured in this.  One of my favourites', '2014-09-29 09:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267213, 1130458, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the reflections caught in the droplets.</td>', 'Really like the reflections caught in the droplets.', '2014-09-29 09:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267214, 1130460, 149964, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites, the contrasting colours and composition are just up my street. Love the blur of the water as it falls.</td>', 'One of my favourites, the contrasting colours and composition are just up my street. Love the blur of the water as it falls.', '2014-09-29 09:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267215, 1130481, 24073, '<td valign="top">I know this must have water in it, but its hard to see.  What a great all around shot though, I would hang this on my wall in heartbeat, I absolutely love it.  Its just very hard to vote it in the highest rankings because of the demand for a water shot, and in short it just really doesn''t bring that water out, and make it stand on its own.</td>', 'I know this must have water in it, but its hard to see.  What a great all around shot though, I would hang this on my wall in heartbeat, I absolutely love it.  Its just very hard to vote it in the highest rankings because of the demand for a water shot, and in short it just really doesn''t bring that water out, and make it stand on its own.', '2014-09-29 09:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267216, 1130431, 149964, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. Hope your description will include a guide on how you did it! Really like the orange tints contrasting with the green.</td>', 'One of my favourites. Hope your description will include a guide on how you did it! Really like the orange tints contrasting with the green.', '2014-09-29 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267217, 1130305, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever! Hopefully you''ll explain how you captured this in your description. Love the movement and colours captured on this. One of my favourites.</td>', 'Clever! Hopefully you''ll explain how you captured this in your description. Love the movement and colours captured on this. One of my favourites.', '2014-09-29 09:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267218, 1130003, 24073, '<td valign="top">One bright white and red surfboard away from having a potentially winning shot.  I still like it a lot, it will just be really hard to stand it among the finalist...who knows though.  gL.</td>', 'One bright white and red surfboard away from having a potentially winning shot.  I still like it a lot, it will just be really hard to stand it among the finalist...who knows though.  gL.', '2014-09-29 09:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267220, 1130258, 30364, '<td valign="top">The most engaging photograph in the challenge.  The composition, the framing, is perfect.  It has the economy of a great drawing, where no mark is superfluous, and no space however empty is squandered.  Beautiful tones, elegant Euclidean geometry, and a hidden narrative throbbing just beneath the skin like a heartbeat.  It''s like a storyboard for an indie film, with a plot development graphic built in.  Alas, it''s the Order of the Thumb for you, plus a 10, plus a thank you for your photograph.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The most engaging photograph in the challenge.  The composition, the framing, is perfect.  It has the economy of a great drawing, where no mark is superfluous, and no space however empty is squandered.  Beautiful tones, elegant Euclidean geometry, and a hidden narrative throbbing just beneath the skin like a heartbeat.  It''s like a storyboard for an indie film, with a plot development graphic built in.  Alas, it''s the Order of the Thumb for you, plus a 10, plus a thank you for your photograph.', '2014-09-29 09:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267222, 1130390, 24073, '<td valign="top">Great, great, great.  Love what you have captured here, and you make it look very expert like.</td>', 'Great, great, great.  Love what you have captured here, and you make it look very expert like.', '2014-09-29 09:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267224, 1130141, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really love the melting effects on this, Colours are just lovely and the crystalline details in the ice cubes beautifully sharp. One of my favourites.</td>', 'Really love the melting effects on this, Colours are just lovely and the crystalline details in the ice cubes beautifully sharp. One of my favourites.', '2014-09-29 09:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267225, 1130191, 149964, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. Simple, crisp and clean. My only (very small) niggle is the marking on the to the left of the picture; feel like I want to get a cloth to polish it away......</td>', 'One of my favourites. Simple, crisp and clean. My only (very small) niggle is the marking on the to the left of the picture; feel like I want to get a cloth to polish it away......', '2014-09-29 09:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267226, 1130436, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lovely crips and clear image. The slice of lemon is so refreshing looking!</td>', 'Lovely crips and clear image. The slice of lemon is so refreshing looking!', '2014-09-29 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267228, 1130488, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the refraction of the light and the way the gentle movement has been captured</td>', 'Really like the refraction of the light and the way the gentle movement has been captured', '2014-09-29 09:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267229, 1130136, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the tranquility of the scene.</td>', 'Really like the tranquility of the scene.', '2014-09-29 09:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267230, 1130474, 149964, '<td valign="top">The colours in this really caught my eye and they capture the movement really well.</td>', 'The colours in this really caught my eye and they capture the movement really well.', '2014-09-29 09:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267231, 1130147, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this.', '2014-09-29 09:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267232, 1130041, 149964, '<td valign="top">This is just such a gorgeous picture. A perfect retreat.</td>', 'This is just such a gorgeous picture. A perfect retreat.', '2014-09-29 09:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267233, 1130470, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the tears are highlighted by the simple colours of the background.</td>', 'I really like the way the tears are highlighted by the simple colours of the background.', '2014-09-29 09:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267234, 1130434, 149964, '<td valign="top">The water of life! Great capture. Love the bubbles.</td>', 'The water of life! Great capture. Love the bubbles.', '2014-09-29 09:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267235, 1130480, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really clever capture of the rolling surf.</td>', 'Really clever capture of the rolling surf.', '2014-09-29 09:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267236, 1130352, 24073, '<td valign="top">Way to get outside the box, and submit a shot that is not only different but very intriguing, and satisfying to the eye.  I applaud your creativity, and alone I would give this a 4 for creativity, however it also has great colors, beautiful consistency, and meets the challenge strait forward.  All that said, congratulations, you have earned my first, and only for the moment 10.  GL, I can''t find critique worth mentioning.<br/>   Alright, I just finished voting, and this was my only 10, I''m not a great predictor of winners, but I just wanted to say how much I really liked this shot.</td>', 'Way to get outside the box, and submit a shot that is not only different but very intriguing, and satisfying to the eye.  I applaud your creativity, and alone I would give this a 4 for creativity, however it also has great colors, beautiful consistency, and meets the challenge strait forward.  All that said, congratulations, you have earned my first, and only for the moment 10.  GL, I can''t find critique worth mentioning.   Alright, I just finished voting, and this was my only 10, I''m not a great predictor of winners, but I just wanted to say how much I really liked this shot.', '2014-09-29 09:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267237, 1130112, 149964, '<td valign="top">Like the flow of the water and clever to use B&amp;W.</td>', 'Like the flow of the water and clever to use B&W.', '2014-09-29 09:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267238, 1130412, 149964, '<td valign="top">Simple interpretation but very effective.</td>', 'Simple interpretation but very effective.', '2014-09-29 10:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267239, 1130427, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever subject. I wonder if you could have changed the angle slightly to take him a ''step away'' from the boat so that the Right elbow was clearer?</td>', 'Clever subject. I wonder if you could have changed the angle slightly to take him a ''step away'' from the boat so that the Right elbow was clearer?', '2014-09-29 10:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267240, 1130387, 149964, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture and I love the sharpness of the droplets. I wonder if the base could gave been a little lighter - a little too dark at the bottom for my taste.</td>', 'Pretty picture and I love the sharpness of the droplets. I wonder if the base could gave been a little lighter - a little too dark at the bottom for my taste.', '2014-09-29 10:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267241, 1130037, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and the ripples capture the light beautifully. I find the purple effect a little too strong - especially in the top left corner of the picture.</td>', 'Lovely composition and the ripples capture the light beautifully. I find the purple effect a little too strong - especially in the top left corner of the picture.', '2014-09-29 10:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267242, 1130045, 149964, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene and the movement of the water is well captured.  Personally I''d have liked a little less processing.</td>', 'Pretty scene and the movement of the water is well captured.  Personally I''d have liked a little less processing.', '2014-09-29 10:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267243, 1130485, 149964, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to work out the dappling effect and then I read the title! I really like this photograph and the stippling provided by the rains is just beautiful.</td>', 'Took me a while to work out the dappling effect and then I read the title! I really like this photograph and the stippling provided by the rains is just beautiful.', '2014-09-29 10:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267244, 1130357, 149964, '<td valign="top">I love the light on this and the way it brings out the green. I wonder if there was a way to could have been sharper....the blurs are fab but I think I''d have liked something to focus my eye on.</td>', 'I love the light on this and the way it brings out the green. I wonder if there was a way to could have been sharper....the blurs are fab but I think I''d have liked something to focus my eye on.', '2014-09-29 10:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267245, 1130459, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like the crystal clarity of this shot and the way the ripples and movement catch the light.</td>', 'I really like the crystal clarity of this shot and the way the ripples and movement catch the light.', '2014-09-29 10:09:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7267247, 1130117, 149964, '<td valign="top">Also reminds me of Constable''s haywain - I think it must the tree colours......! Not sure he would have approved of the impressionist feel but I certainly do!.</td>', 'Also reminds me of Constable''s haywain - I think it must the tree colours......! Not sure he would have approved of the impressionist feel but I certainly do!.', '2014-09-29 10:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267249, 1130462, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lovely tranquil shot and the pink burst of the flower sets it off nicely.</td>', 'Lovely tranquil shot and the pink burst of the flower sets it off nicely.', '2014-09-29 10:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267250, 1130376, 149964, '<td valign="top">A pretty picture and I like the way the droplets are captured against the light.</td>', 'A pretty picture and I like the way the droplets are captured against the light.', '2014-09-29 10:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267251, 1130355, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the blues i this and the sense of movement of the water.</td>', 'Really like the blues i this and the sense of movement of the water.', '2014-09-29 10:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267253, 1130384, 149964, '<td valign="top">My favourite part of this photograph is the reflection of the light on the rippling waves. The star effect is clever but personally I find it a little distracting - I feel like I''d like to move it somewhere else.</td>', 'My favourite part of this photograph is the reflection of the light on the rippling waves. The star effect is clever but personally I find it a little distracting - I feel like I''d like to move it somewhere else.', '2014-09-29 10:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267254, 1130377, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the subject of this picture and the top adds a great splash of colour. My only little niggle is that my eyes are led out of the bottom left of the photo - I think they''re looking for the tip of the boot  :-)</td>', 'I like the subject of this picture and the top adds a great splash of colour. My only little niggle is that my eyes are led out of the bottom left of the photo - I think they''re looking for the tip of the boot  :-)', '2014-09-29 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267255, 1130321, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lovely tranquil shot and the reflection is pretty. I think I''d have liked the trees and hills to have been a little sharper.</td>', 'Lovely tranquil shot and the reflection is pretty. I think I''d have liked the trees and hills to have been a little sharper.', '2014-09-29 10:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267256, 1130353, 149964, '<td valign="top">A pretty and clever capture; good choice for the challenge.</td>', 'A pretty and clever capture; good choice for the challenge.', '2014-09-29 10:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267258, 1130420, 149964, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a great moment to capture! I''m a little perturbed by the bright pea-green colour of the water splashing upon the foreground.  Is this pollution, processing or something I''ve just not come across before?</td>', 'Wow - what a great moment to capture! I''m a little perturbed by the bright pea-green colour of the water splashing upon the foreground.  Is this pollution, processing or something I''ve just not come across before?', '2014-09-29 10:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267259, 1130371, 149964, '<td valign="top">Pretty view and the colours are lovely.  The water blur is good but I think I''d have liked a little more sharpness in the trees to set it off even more.</td>', 'Pretty view and the colours are lovely.  The water blur is good but I think I''d have liked a little more sharpness in the trees to set it off even more.', '2014-09-29 10:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267260, 1130432, 149964, '<td valign="top">A lovely tranquil scene and I really like the soft colours.</td>', 'A lovely tranquil scene and I really like the soft colours.', '2014-09-29 10:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267261, 1130413, 149964, '<td valign="top">Every time I see this I smile! Lovely capture; great subject and model.</td>', 'Every time I see this I smile! Lovely capture; great subject and model.', '2014-09-29 10:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267262, 1130479, 149964, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft view and I really like the pinky hues.</td>', 'Lovely soft view and I really like the pinky hues.', '2014-09-29 10:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267263, 1130219, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and the reflection is just lovely. I think I may have preferred it with some of the rocky foreground cropped so that there was more emphasis on the water.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and the reflection is just lovely. I think I may have preferred it with some of the rocky foreground cropped so that there was more emphasis on the water.', '2014-09-29 10:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267264, 1130477, 149964, '<td valign="top">Moody! A lovely view but the sky detracts from the water as the subject.</td>', 'Moody! A lovely view but the sky detracts from the water as the subject.', '2014-09-29 10:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267265, 1130278, 149964, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene although I''d have liked the water drawn out a little more; I have a hint of the ripples but would like to have them brought out a little.</td>', 'A beautiful scene although I''d have liked the water drawn out a little more; I have a hint of the ripples but would like to have them brought out a little.', '2014-09-29 10:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267268, 1130048, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever sharp capture of the ager drops. I wonder if you could have angled it to miss out the shadow (car?)  It''s drawing my eye from the main subject as it is rather sharp/geometrical whilst the rest is more natural.</td>', 'Clever sharp capture of the ager drops. I wonder if you could have angled it to miss out the shadow (car?)  It''s drawing my eye from the main subject as it is rather sharp/geometrical whilst the rest is more natural.', '2014-09-29 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267269, 1130019, 149964, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene and I think the blur is just right: soft enough without losing the detail of the flow.</td>', 'Pretty scene and I think the blur is just right: soft enough without losing the detail of the flow.', '2014-09-29 10:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267272, 1130331, 149964, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t be surprised if you told me their was a burning Viking funeral pyre about to sail into view! Lovely atmospheric shot - the sea is on fire!</td>', 'Wouldn''t be surprised if you told me their was a burning Viking funeral pyre about to sail into view! Lovely atmospheric shot - the sea is on fire!', '2014-09-29 10:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267274, 1130378, 149964, '<td valign="top">I''m still getting used to the ''stylised'' effects of some of the entries as I prefer more natural views. Nonetheless, this is a great picture and has good contrasting colours and lines. I particularly like the burst of the splashing water.</td>', 'I''m still getting used to the ''stylised'' effects of some of the entries as I prefer more natural views. Nonetheless, this is a great picture and has good contrasting colours and lines. I particularly like the burst of the splashing water.', '2014-09-29 10:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267275, 1130482, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this and the contrast of the water and light is lovely.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this and the contrast of the water and light is lovely.', '2014-09-29 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267276, 1130252, 149964, '<td valign="top">Fun! Really captured the life of the water (and the subject) in this.</td>', 'Fun! Really captured the life of the water (and the subject) in this.', '2014-09-29 10:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267277, 1130055, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot and the colours. I find the shadow/dark line rather prominent and it is distracting me from the glass a little.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot and the colours. I find the shadow/dark line rather prominent and it is distracting me from the glass a little.', '2014-09-29 10:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267298, 1130429, 149964, '<td valign="top">A lovely peaceful view and I like the colours in particular.</td>', 'A lovely peaceful view and I like the colours in particular.', '2014-09-29 10:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267300, 1130143, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject and the general light is lovely, however, I do find the very bright light and its reflection a little overwhelming.</td>', 'I really like the subject and the general light is lovely, however, I do find the very bright light and its reflection a little overwhelming.', '2014-09-29 10:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267302, 1130390, 149964, '<td valign="top">A lovely capture of youngsters having fun! And TWO water sources - their ''water guns'' and the sea - good for the challenge!</td>', 'A lovely capture of youngsters having fun! And TWO water sources - their ''water guns'' and the sea - good for the challenge!', '2014-09-29 10:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267303, 1130213, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the atmosphere in this shot and lovely tones on the skin.</td>', 'I like the atmosphere in this shot and lovely tones on the skin.', '2014-09-29 10:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267305, 1130430, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the action shot and the water movement is well captured - I think I''d like to have seen more of it for the purpose of the challenge.</td>', 'I like the action shot and the water movement is well captured - I think I''d like to have seen more of it for the purpose of the challenge.', '2014-09-29 10:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267306, 1130472, 149964, '<td valign="top">Dreamy water which is lovely although I think I''d have liked the rocks just a little sharper.</td>', 'Dreamy water which is lovely although I think I''d have liked the rocks just a little sharper.', '2014-09-29 10:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267312, 1130186, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever capture of the reflections and water movement. I wonder if it might have been improved a little if the top , central(ish) vertical reflection was cropped out?</td>', 'Clever capture of the reflections and water movement. I wonder if it might have been improved a little if the top , central(ish) vertical reflection was cropped out?', '2014-09-29 10:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267313, 1130417, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the reflection and the perspective on this. Colours good too.</td>', 'Really like the reflection and the perspective on this. Colours good too.', '2014-09-29 10:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267314, 1130021, 149964, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I see and the more I like it.  I think the contrast is good and the lines too.</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I see and the more I like it.  I think the contrast is good and the lines too.', '2014-09-29 10:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267316, 1130127, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the orange contrast on the dark blue water, which accentuates the ripples well. I''d have liked something for my eye to settle on - be that an obvious focal point or a distinct subject.</td>', 'Really like the orange contrast on the dark blue water, which accentuates the ripples well. I''d have liked something for my eye to settle on - be that an obvious focal point or a distinct subject.', '2014-09-29 10:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267318, 1130123, 149964, '<td valign="top">A pretty scene although I fond myself drawn more to the sky than the water. I like the way the person is reflected in the water which adds something to the landscape.</td>', 'A pretty scene although I fond myself drawn more to the sky than the water. I like the way the person is reflected in the water which adds something to the landscape.', '2014-09-29 11:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267319, 1130453, 149964, '<td valign="top">A clever capture of both still and moving water.</td>', 'A clever capture of both still and moving water.', '2014-09-29 11:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267323, 1130428, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of movement that has been captured in this and its a great subject for the challenge.</td>', 'I like the sense of movement that has been captured in this and its a great subject for the challenge.', '2014-09-29 11:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267324, 1130455, 149964, '<td valign="top">A pretty scene and the ducks provide a really good foreground against the waterspray.</td>', 'A pretty scene and the ducks provide a really good foreground against the waterspray.', '2014-09-29 11:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267325, 1130475, 149964, '<td valign="top">Pretty colours and the water movement is well captured.</td>', 'Pretty colours and the water movement is well captured.', '2014-09-29 11:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267326, 1130392, 149964, '<td valign="top">A pretty, tranquil scene and I like the reflection of the sky which accentuates the water,</td>', 'A pretty, tranquil scene and I like the reflection of the sky which accentuates the water,', '2014-09-29 11:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267329, 1130478, 149964, '<td valign="top">A clever use of blurring and light sprinkles (am sure there''s a technical name but I don''t know it!) to add a dreaminess to this picture.</td>', 'A clever use of blurring and light sprinkles (am sure there''s a technical name but I don''t know it!) to add a dreaminess to this picture.', '2014-09-29 11:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267332, 1130014, 149964, '<td valign="top">A moody scene and very dramatic but there''s something a bit too dark and I''m not sure I can pinpoint what it is - maybe it''s the very dark lower left corner....</td>', 'A moody scene and very dramatic but there''s something a bit too dark and I''m not sure I can pinpoint what it is - maybe it''s the very dark lower left corner....', '2014-09-29 11:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267333, 1130003, 149964, '<td valign="top">Good colours and captures the movement of the water well.</td>', 'Good colours and captures the movement of the water well.', '2014-09-29 11:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267334, 1130172, 149964, '<td valign="top">A good simple shot and I like the bokeh (I think that''s the word) behind the droplets.</td>', 'A good simple shot and I like the bokeh (I think that''s the word) behind the droplets.', '2014-09-29 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267335, 1130466, 149964, '<td valign="top">What a lovely, simple shot.</td>', 'What a lovely, simple shot.', '2014-09-29 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267336, 1130425, 149964, '<td valign="top">A sweet picture - looks like the second from the right is dancing! I think I would have liked the birds to be a little sharper.</td>', 'A sweet picture - looks like the second from the right is dancing! I think I would have liked the birds to be a little sharper.', '2014-09-29 11:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267337, 1130476, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts of light and dark.</td>', 'I like the contrasts of light and dark.', '2014-09-29 11:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267339, 1130419, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever capture of a rainbow effect.</td>', 'Clever capture of a rainbow effect.', '2014-09-29 11:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267340, 1130347, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever subject and good for the challenge. I prefer the left hand side of the picture; not sure if it''s the steam or the focus that is distracting me on the right.</td>', 'Clever subject and good for the challenge. I prefer the left hand side of the picture; not sure if it''s the steam or the focus that is distracting me on the right.', '2014-09-29 11:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267341, 1130054, 149964, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot and, whilst the boat provides a clear connection to water, I''d have lied to have seen more of the challenge subject itself.</td>', 'A lovely shot and, whilst the boat provides a clear connection to water, I''d have lied to have seen more of the challenge subject itself.', '2014-09-29 11:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267342, 1130352, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the water and the main subject.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the water and the main subject.', '2014-09-29 11:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267343, 1130373, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like the swirls! I find the reflection just a little too bright/harsh, more so in the lower part of the picture; middle and top are lovely.</td>', 'Really like the swirls! I find the reflection just a little too bright/harsh, more so in the lower part of the picture; middle and top are lovely.', '2014-09-29 11:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267344, 1130415, 149964, '<td valign="top">My favourite sort of scenery: sea and rocks/cliffs. Blues of the water are beautifully captured.</td>', 'My favourite sort of scenery: sea and rocks/cliffs. Blues of the water are beautifully captured.', '2014-09-29 11:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267345, 1130060, 149964, '<td valign="top">I really like the atmosphere in this and the ripples bring out the ''texture'' of the water well.</td>', 'I really like the atmosphere in this and the ripples bring out the ''texture'' of the water well.', '2014-09-29 11:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267346, 1130471, 149964, '<td valign="top">Sunshine! Lovely sparkly patterns. I find the central lower light spot is a little overpowering.</td>', 'Sunshine! Lovely sparkly patterns. I find the central lower light spot is a little overpowering.', '2014-09-29 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267347, 1130486, 149964, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to realise what I was looking at.  Sneaky things! Really like the reflection of the trees.</td>', 'Took me a moment to realise what I was looking at.  Sneaky things! Really like the reflection of the trees.', '2014-09-29 11:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267348, 1130031, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really clever picture and good use of reflections.</td>', 'Really clever picture and good use of reflections.', '2014-09-29 11:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267349, 1130473, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever but just a little too much black for my taste.</td>', 'Clever but just a little too much black for my taste.', '2014-09-29 11:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267352, 1130258, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever. Confusing, but clever!</td>', 'Clever. Confusing, but clever!', '2014-09-29 11:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7267354, 1130332, 149964, '<td valign="top">I'' have liked this to have been a little sharper. I think the division between sea, sand and buildings provides good diagonal lines.</td>', 'I'' have liked this to have been a little sharper. I think the division between sea, sand and buildings provides good diagonal lines.', '2014-09-29 11:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
