(7268016, 1130397, 13077, '<td valign="top">Life through a water bottle, what an idea. I wonder what my day-to-day life would look like through a water bottle. Maybe I''ll walk into work tomorrow with my face pressed against one to see. Maybe someone will call me crazy.<br/> <br/>I guess I still don''t know what this is a picture of, but at least I know how it came about.</td>', 'Life through a water bottle, what an idea. I wonder what my day-to-day life would look like through a water bottle. Maybe I''ll walk into work tomorrow with my face pressed against one to see. Maybe someone will call me crazy. I guess I still don''t know what this is a picture of, but at least I know how it came about.', '2014-10-01 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
