(7268208, 1130136, 19825, '<td valign="top">I found this fascinating, and I love the colors and composition (I was one of your 7''s). Many of us try to capture a shot that pleases the masses. Sometimes we have to be happy the image connects with a few. Hey, you caught <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a>''s eye -- in my book I''d call that a success. It''s a cool shot -- nice job.</td>', 'I found this fascinating, and I love the colors and composition (I was one of your 7''s). Many of us try to capture a shot that pleases the masses. Sometimes we have to be happy the image connects with a few. Hey, you caught  ubique''s eye -- in my book I''d call that a success. It''s a cool shot -- nice job.', '2014-10-01 11:45:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7268215, 1130474, 20799, '<td valign="top">So great to see you again on THIS particular challenge! My own entry was inspired by your work. Congrats on the ribbon, the front page needed this!</td>', 'So great to see you again on THIS particular challenge! My own entry was inspired by your work. Congrats on the ribbon, the front page needed this!', '2014-10-01 12:13:32.000000', NULL, 0),
